 note='Against DR 500 it puts 5x64 = 320 through per turn, against 306 per shot for the 90mm HEAVY RIFLE (5 EP), at 1 EP less. It only gets 3 full bursts, and each adds +3 heat. On a Light Fission Cell (HEAT 7) two bursts reach the danger zone, and the feed dies to any penetrating arm hit.',
